cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its derived data, please cite it as below."
title: "fuji-fair-pipeline: a F-UJI FAIR-assessment pipeline for research data repositories"
abstract: >-
  A four-stage pipeline that harvests dataset metadata from Dataverse, 
  Zenodo/InvenioRDM, and Chemotion repositories, scores each record with the F-UJI FAIR
  evaluator, and produces per-repository and cross-repository FAIR analysis.
type: software
